UID:w4-mon-speedA@project225
DTSTAMP:20260908T154719Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261005T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261005T120000
SUMMARY:P225 · Speed A · Overspeed\, no ball (deload)
DESCRIPTION:Do this before Gym 1\, while the nervous system is fresh. Ev
 ery swing is max intent.\n\nDeload: 1 round\, no step-through swings\, 
 6 max-effort driver swings.\n\nWarm-up 8 min: 90/90s\, open-books\, leg
  swings\, then 10 progressive swings from 60% to 90%.\nOverspeed round 
 = light 5/5/5\, medium 5/5/5\, heavy 5/5/5 (dominant side / non-dominan
 t side / step-through). Rest 60–90 s between sets.\nBlock 1: 2 rounds
  (90 swings). Note the peak speed at each weight.\nFinisher: 10 max-eff
 ort driver swings on the radar. Record the peak club speed.\nWith the S
 tack: follow the app's prescribed session instead of the fixed rounds 
 — it periodizes the weights for you.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:P225 · Speed A · Overspeed\, no ball (deload)
TRIGGER:-PT30M
END:VALARM
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:P225 · Speed A · Overspeed\, no ball (deload)
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
