DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261005T131000
SUMMARY:P225 · Gym 1 · Lower strength + vertical power (deload)
DESCRIPTION:Squat pattern\, hinge\, single-leg\, lateral push-off. Verti
 cal force is the biggest single lever on club speed.\n\nDeload: A-serie
 s 2 sets. Squat 3×5 @ 65–70%. Accessories 2 sets each.\n\nA1 Box jum
 p or countermovement jump — 4×3\nA2 Hang power clean — Technique 3
 ×3\, light (optional)\nB Back squat — 4×6 @ 72–77%\nC Romanian de
 adlift — 3×8\nD1 Rear-foot-elevated split squat — 3×8 / leg\nD2 L
 ateral lunge or Cossack squat — 3×8 / side\nE1 Pallof press — 3×1
 0 / side\nE2 Suitcase carry — 3×30 m / side
