DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261006T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261006T123500
SUMMARY:P225 · Gym 2 · Upper strength + rotational power (deload)
DESCRIPTION:Throws first while you're fresh\, then press and pull heavy\
 , then the rotational cable work that builds the release.\n\nDeload: th
 rows 2 sets. Bench 3×5 @ 65–70%. Pull-ups 3×5 bodyweight. Accessori
 es 2 sets.\n\nA1 Med ball rotational scoop throw (wall) — 4×4 / side
  · 8–10 lb\nA2 Med ball chest pass / shot put — 4×4 · 8–10 lb\
 nB Bench press — 4×6 @ 72–77%\nC Weighted pull-up — 4×6\nD1 Hal
 f-kneeling landmine press — 3×8 / side\nD2 Chest-supported row — 3
 ×10\nE1 Cable chop and lift — 3×10 / side\nE2 Face pull — 3×15\n
 E3 Wrist roller or plate pinch — 3 sets
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:P225 · Gym 2 · Upper strength + rotational power (deload)
TRIGGER:-PT30M
