UID:w4-wed-speedB@project225
DTSTAMP:20260908T154719Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261007T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261007T121000
SUMMARY:P225 · Speed B · Overspeed + hitting (deload)
DESCRIPTION:Range or net with the radar. Half technique\, half intent. T
 his is where club speed becomes ball speed.\n\nDeload: no overspeed. 20
  balls at 80–85% working on centre contact. No max effort.\n\nWarm-up
  10 min: mobility\, 10 wedge swings\, 10 7-iron swings\, 6 driver at 80
 %.\nOverspeed: 1 round\, light and medium only.\n12 drivers at 85–90%
 : foot spray or impact tape on the face\, find centre contact. Smash fa
 ctor is your feedback (target 1.48–1.50).\n3 × 6-ball sets at max in
 tent\, 3 min between sets. Record peak ball speed\, peak club speed\, a
 nd smash.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:P225 · Speed B · Overspeed + hitting (deload)
TRIGGER:-PT30M
END:VALARM
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:P225 · Speed B · Overspeed + hitting (deload)
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
