DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261008T124000
SUMMARY:P225 · Gym 3 · Lower hypertrophy + posterior chain (deload)
DESCRIPTION:Deadlift day. Horizontal and lateral jumps up front\, then t
 he volume that builds glutes and hamstrings.\n\nDeload: jumps 2 sets. T
 rap bar 3×5 @ 65–70%. Accessories 2 sets. Skip carries.\n\nA1 Broad 
 jump — 4×3\nA2 Lateral bound (stick the landing) — 4×3 / side\nB 
 Trap bar deadlift — 4×6 @ 72–77%\nC Front squat (or hack squat) 
 — 3×8–10\nD1 Barbell hip thrust — 3×10\nD2 Nordic curl or lying
  leg curl — 3×8\nE1 Copenhagen plank — 3×30 s / side\nE2 Standing
  calf raise — 3×12\nE3 Farmer carry — 3×40 m
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:P225 · Gym 3 · Lower hypertrophy + posterior chain (deload
 )
TRIGGER:-PT30M
END:VALARM
