DTSTAMP:20260908T154719Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261010T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261010T115000
SUMMARY:P225 · Speed C · Max hit day (deload)
DESCRIPTION:The session that produces the number. Friday is a rest day s
 o you arrive fresh. Every ball on the radar.\n\nDeload (weeks 4 and 8):
  retest day instead — see the Setup tab tests. 2 × 6-ball sets\, the
 n done.\n\nWarm-up 15 min: mobility\, 20 progressive swings wedge → 7
 -iron → driver\, 6 drivers at 80–90%.\n4 × 6-ball sets on a 2:45 c
 lock\, 5 min rest between sets. Log every ball speed\; the session numb
 er is your peak\, and note the top-3 average.\nStop rule: if a set's av
 erage drops more than 3% below your best set\, the session is over. Spe
 ed under fatigue is where obliques and backs get hurt.\nCap: 30 max-eff
 ort hits. Then Gym 4 at least 3 hours later.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:P225 · Speed C · Max hit day (deload)
TRIGGER:-PT30M
END:VALARM
