DESCRIPTION:After the max hit day (3+ hours later\, or that evening). Pu
 re mass work — shoulders\, back\, arms\, forearms. Nothing here shoul
 d feel heroic.\n\nDeload: 2 sets of everything\, stop 3 reps short of f
 ailure.\n\nB Push press (or strict overhead press) — 4×8\nC Lat pull
 down or pull-up — 4×8–10\nD1 Incline dumbbell press — 3×10\nD2 
 Seated cable row — 3×10–12\nE1 Lateral raise — 3×15\nE2 Rear de
 lt fly — 3×15\nF1 Hammer curl — 3×12\nF2 Triceps pushdown — 3×
 12\nF3 Reverse curl + wrist curl — 3×12 each
