SUMMARY:P225 · Speed A · Overspeed\, no ball
DESCRIPTION:Do this before Gym 1\, while the nervous system is fresh. Ev
 ery swing is max intent.\n\nWarm-up 8 min as in Block 1.\nOverspeed: 3 
 rounds of light/medium/heavy 5/5/5 (135 swings). Rest 60–90 s.\nAdd 5
  "hold the finish" swings with the heavy weight to train the decelerati
 on side.\nFinisher: 10 max-effort driver swings on the radar. Record pe
 ak club speed.
