SUMMARY:P225 · Gym 1 · Lower strength + vertical power
DESCRIPTION:Squat pattern\, hinge\, single-leg\, lateral push-off. Verti
 cal force is the biggest single lever on club speed.\n\nA1 Box jump or 
 countermovement jump — 4×3\nA2 Hang power clean — 5×3 @ 70–75%\
 nB Back squat — 5×4 @ 80–85% → box jump ×3 after each set\nC Ro
 manian deadlift — 4×6\nD1 Rear-foot-elevated split squat — 3×8 / 
 leg\nD2 Lateral lunge or Cossack squat — 3×8 / side\nE1 Pallof press
  — 3×10 / side\nE2 Suitcase carry — 3×30 m / side
