DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261027T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261027T123500
SUMMARY:P225 · Gym 2 · Upper strength + rotational power
DESCRIPTION:Throws first while you're fresh\, then press and pull heavy\
 , then the rotational cable work that builds the release.\n\nA1 Med bal
 l rotational scoop throw (wall) — 5×3 / side · 10–12 lb\nA2 Med b
 all chest pass / shot put — 5×3 · 10–12 lb\nB Bench press — 5×
 4 @ 80–85%\nC Weighted pull-up — 5×5\nD1 Half-kneeling landmine pr
 ess — 3×8 / side\nD2 Chest-supported row — 4×8\nE1 Cable chop and
  lift — 4×8 / side\nE2 Face pull — 3×15\nE3 Wrist roller or plate
  pinch — 3 sets
