DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261028T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261028T121000
SUMMARY:P225 · Speed B · Overspeed + hitting
DESCRIPTION:Range or net with the radar. Half technique\, half intent. T
 his is where club speed becomes ball speed.\n\nWarm-up 10 min as in Blo
 ck 1.\nOverspeed: 2 rounds\, light and medium only.\n10 drivers at 85
 –90% on the tape. Then 3 × 6-ball sets at max intent\, 3 min rest.\n
 Tee height and ball position audit every session: you want +5° to +8°
  attack angle — if the radar's distance number lags ball speed\, you'
 re hitting down.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:P225 · Speed B · Overspeed + hitting
TRIGGER:-PT30M
END:VALARM
