SUMMARY:P225 · Gym 3 · Lower hypertrophy + posterior chain
DESCRIPTION:Deadlift day. Horizontal and lateral jumps up front\, then t
 he volume that builds glutes and hamstrings.\n\nA1 Broad jump — 4×3\
 nA2 Lateral bound (stick the landing) — 4×3 / side\nB Trap bar deadl
 ift — 5×4 @ 80–85% → trap bar jump ×3 after each set\nC Front s
 quat (or hack squat) — 4×6\nD1 Barbell hip thrust — 4×8\nD2 Nordi
 c curl or lying leg curl — 3×8\nE1 Copenhagen plank — 3×40 s / si
 de\nE2 Standing calf raise — 3×12\nE3 Farmer carry — 3×40 m\, hea
 vier
