DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261031T115000
SUMMARY:P225 · Speed C · Max hit day
DESCRIPTION:The session that produces the number. Friday is a rest day s
 o you arrive fresh. Every ball on the radar.\n\nWarm-up 15 min.\n5 × 6
 -ball sets on a 2:45 clock\, 5 min rest. Same logging.\nIn-grid counts 
 too: mark how many of 6 land in a 60-yard-wide grid. Two of six is the 
 competition floor.\nStop rule and 30-hit cap unchanged.
