 ery swing is max intent.\n\nWarm-up 8 min.\nOverspeed: 3 rounds weeks 9
 –11\; 1 round week 12 (taper).\nLight and medium only in the third ro
 und — chase the number\, not fatigue.\nFinisher: 8 max-effort driver 
