DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261116T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261116T131000
SUMMARY:P225 · Gym 1 · Lower strength + vertical power
DESCRIPTION:Squat pattern\, hinge\, single-leg\, lateral push-off. Verti
 cal force is the biggest single lever on club speed.\n\nA1 Box jump or 
 countermovement jump — Trap bar jump 5×3 @ 20–30% BW\nA2 Hang powe
 r clean — 6×2 @ 78–85%\nB Back squat — 3×3 @ 85%\, then 3×3 @ 
 60% as fast as possible\nC Romanian deadlift — 3×5\nD1 Rear-foot-ele
 vated split squat — 3×6 / leg\nD2 Lateral lunge or Cossack squat —
  Skater bound 4×4 / side\nE1 Pallof press — 3×8 / side\, fast\nE2 S
 uitcase carry — 3×30 m / side
