UID:w10-tue-gym2@project225
DTSTAMP:20260908T154719Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261117T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261117T123500
SUMMARY:P225 · Gym 2 · Upper strength + rotational power
DESCRIPTION:Throws first while you're fresh\, then press and pull heavy\
 , then the rotational cable work that builds the release.\n\nA1 Med bal
 l rotational scoop throw (wall) — 6×3 / side · 6–8 lb\, max speed
 \nA2 Med ball chest pass / shot put — Plyo push-up 5×3\nB Bench pres
 s — 3×3 @ 85%\, then 3×3 @ 60% fast\nC Weighted pull-up — 4×4\nD
 1 Half-kneeling landmine press — Landmine rotational press 3×6 / sid
 e\nD2 Chest-supported row — 3×8\nE1 Cable chop and lift — 3×8 / s
 ide\, fast\nE2 Face pull — 2×15\nE3 Wrist roller or plate pinch — 
 2 sets
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:P225 · Gym 2 · Upper strength + rotational power
TRIGGER:-PT30M
END:VALARM
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:P225 · Gym 2 · Upper strength + rotational power
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
