UID:w10-wed-speedB@project225
DTSTAMP:20260908T154719Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261118T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261118T121000
SUMMARY:P225 · Speed B · Overspeed + hitting
DESCRIPTION:Range or net with the radar. Half technique\, half intent. T
 his is where club speed becomes ball speed.\n\nWarm-up 10 min.\nOverspe
 ed: 1 round\, light only.\n8 drivers at 90%\, then 4 × 6-ball sets on 
 a 2:45 clock (competition rhythm).\nWeek 12: 2 sets only.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:P225 · Speed B · Overspeed + hitting
TRIGGER:-PT30M
END:VALARM
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:P225 · Speed B · Overspeed + hitting
TRIGGER:-PT15M
