DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261120T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261120T114500
SUMMARY:P225 · Speed D · Light technique (optional)
DESCRIPTION:Blocks 2–3 only\, and only if you feel fresh. Skip it with
 out guilt — Saturday matters more.\n\n1 round\, light only\, 90% inte
 nt. Week 12: skip.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:P225 · Speed D · Light technique (optional)
TRIGGER:-PT30M
END:VALARM
