DTSTAMP:20260908T154719Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261121T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261121T115000
SUMMARY:P225 · Speed C · Max hit day
DESCRIPTION:The session that produces the number. Friday is a rest day s
 o you arrive fresh. Every ball on the radar.\n\nWarm-up 15 min.\n5 × 6
 -ball sets weeks 9–11. 2 sets in week 12.\nWeeks 9–11: try one set 
 with a "swing at 110%" cue — measure whether reckless beats controlle
 d for you. Most players find their peak at about 95% control.\nLog peak
 \, top-3 average\, grid count.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:P225 · Speed C · Max hit day
TRIGGER:-PT30M
END:VALARM
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:P225 · Speed C · Max hit day
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
