DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261121T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261121T175500
SUMMARY:P225 · Gym 4 · Upper hypertrophy + arms/grip
DESCRIPTION:After the max hit day (3+ hours later\, or that evening). Pu
 re mass work — shoulders\, back\, arms\, forearms. Nothing here shoul
 d feel heroic.\n\nB Push press (or strict overhead press) — 4×3\nC L
 at pulldown or pull-up — 3×8\nD1 Incline dumbbell press — 3×8\nD2
  Seated cable row — 3×8\nE1 Lateral raise — 2×15\nE2 Rear delt fl
 y — 2×15\nF1 Hammer curl — 2×12\nF2 Triceps pushdown — 2×12\nF
 3 Reverse curl + wrist curl — 2×12 each
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:P225 · Gym 4 · Upper hypertrophy + arms/grip
TRIGGER:-PT30M
END:VALARM
